  Replay      1.3 (2026-11-08): two LD A,I reads made double reads (24 bytes
              of the hidden-ROM page, all three modes); stage 1, 4 runs of 800
              updates in each mode: 90 game addresses equal at every update,
              pace within 0.04 points of 1.2. 1.2 (2026-11-08): Orig. pace
              only, Speed and Enhanced Speed keep their published bytes. 90
              game addresses equal at every update in 6 runs; six tunnel
