              every AY and beeper write identical by update, port and value.
              Briefing and attract demo, every mode: registers including R,
              384 game bytes and sound identical at every loop end.

  Emulator    1.3 (2026-11-08): real .NEXCLASH on a private copy of the
              NextZXOS 26.11 card: default, Enhanced [Speed], Enhanced [Orig.
              pace] equal to nxc.py, driving reached, frames viewed. 1.2
              (2026-11-08): JNext 1.1.104 headless on a private copy of the
              NextZXOS 26.11 card, real .NEXCLASH: default, Enhanced [Speed],
              Enhanced [Orig. pace]: /tmp/NEXCLASH.NEX equal to nxc.py, menu
              and driving reached, frames viewed; 15-minute soak of Orig.
              pace, no freeze; no person played it. JNext 1.1.104 headless;
              real-loader results are recorded in the run report.

  Coverage    Stages 1-5 from fixtures, tunnel routes, briefing, attract demo,
              time-out game over and return to menu. Not covered: a full
              unassisted playthrough, the final ending, joystick options.

  Hardware    none

  Nothing here claims a result on real hardware unless the line above says so.

-- HOW TO USE ----------------------------------------------------------------
  Put this .nxc and the game file in the same folder on the Next's card and
  choose the .nxc in the Browser. See README.txt.
